WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:14.964
<v Host>Welcome to Japanese Daily News. I'm Maya. Today is May thirtieth. Today's story is fun: the new Detective Conan movie has become a huge hit in Japan. Let's listen.

00:00:15.564 --> 00:00:21.036
<v News>アニメ「名探偵コナン」の、映画のニュースです。

00:00:21.736 --> 00:00:26.416
<v News>コナンは、とても人気があるアニメです。

00:00:27.115 --> 00:00:31.675
<v News>子供から大人まで、みんなが好きです。

00:00:32.375 --> 00:00:38.183
<v News>コナンのアニメは、30年以上、続いています。

00:00:38.884 --> 00:00:44.140
<v News>毎年、春に、新しい映画が出ます。

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:49.064
<v News>今年も、新しい映画が出ました。

00:00:49.764 --> 00:00:54.731
<v News>4月10日から、映画館で始まりました。

00:00:55.432 --> 00:01:00.112
<v News>たくさんの人が、映画館に行きました。

00:01:00.811 --> 00:01:06.500
<v News>この映画を見た人は、740万人です。

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:11.951
<v News>お金は、108億円を超えました。

00:01:12.652 --> 00:01:16.924
<v News>これは、とても大きい数字です。

00:01:17.623 --> 00:01:24.128
<v News>コナンの映画は、4年、続けて100億円を超えました。

00:01:24.828 --> 00:01:30.420
<v News>これは、日本の映画で、初めてのことです。

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:35.560
<v News>コナンは、世界でも人気があります。

00:01:36.260 --> 00:01:41.420
<v News>ファンは、次の映画も楽しみにしています。

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:43.751
<v Host>Let's break it down.

00:01:44.352 --> 00:01:49.680
<v Slow>コナンは、とても人気があるアニメです。

00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:53.215
<v Host>Conan is a very popular anime.

00:01:53.816 --> 00:01:56.048
<v Vocab>人気

00:01:56.447 --> 00:02:02.855
<v Host>It means popularity, or being popular. You attach it to anything that lots of people love.

00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:08.663
<v Slow>子供から大人まで、みんなが好きです。

00:02:09.463 --> 00:02:12.943
<v Host>Everyone, from children to adults, loves it.

00:02:13.544 --> 00:02:15.752
<v Vocab>大人

00:02:16.151 --> 00:02:21.168
<v Host>It means adult, a grown-up. The opposite is the word for child.

00:02:21.768 --> 00:02:28.391
<v Slow>コナンのアニメは、30年以上、続いています。

00:02:29.192 --> 00:02:33.056
<v Host>The Conan anime has continued for more than thirty years.

00:02:33.656 --> 00:02:35.912
<v Vocab>続く

00:02:36.312 --> 00:02:42.192
<v Host>It means to continue or to last. Use it for anything that keeps going over time.

00:02:42.792 --> 00:02:47.616
<v Slow>今年も、新しい映画が出ました。

00:02:48.415 --> 00:02:51.319
<v Host>This year too, a new movie came out.

00:02:51.919 --> 00:02:54.536
<v Vocab>新しい

00:02:54.936 --> 00:02:59.951
<v Host>It means new. It's an adjective, so it can sit right in front of a noun.

00:03:00.551 --> 00:03:06.216
<v Slow>4月10日から、映画館で始まりました。

00:03:07.015 --> 00:03:09.919
<v Host>It started in theaters from April tenth.

00:03:10.520 --> 00:03:12.943
<v Vocab>映画館

00:03:13.343 --> 00:03:19.800
<v Host>It means movie theater. The first part means movie, and the ending points to a building or hall.

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:26.903
<v Slow>この映画を見た人は、740万人です。

00:03:27.704 --> 00:03:32.527
<v Host>The number of people who saw this movie is seven million four hundred thousand.

00:03:33.127 --> 00:03:35.192
<v Vocab>映画

00:03:35.592 --> 00:03:41.592
<v Host>It means movie or film. This is one of the most useful everyday words you'll learn.

00:03:42.192 --> 00:03:47.616
<v Slow>お金は、108億円を超えました。

00:03:48.415 --> 00:03:51.632
<v Host>The money went over ten point eight billion yen.

00:03:52.231 --> 00:03:54.391
<v Vocab>超える

00:03:54.792 --> 00:04:00.360
<v Host>It means to exceed, or to go over. Use it whenever a number passes a line.

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:05.831
<v Slow>これは、とても大きい数字です。

00:04:06.632 --> 00:04:08.792
<v Host>This is a very big number.

00:04:09.391 --> 00:04:11.671
<v Vocab>数字

00:04:12.072 --> 00:04:17.567
<v Host>It means a number or figure, the kind you write down. Think of digits on a page.

00:04:18.168 --> 00:04:24.552
<v Slow>これは、日本の映画で、初めてのことです。

00:04:25.351 --> 00:04:29.000
<v Host>This is the first time ever for a Japanese movie.

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:32.024
<v Vocab>初めて

00:04:32.423 --> 00:04:37.271
<v Host>It means for the first time. People also say it when meeting someone new.

00:04:37.872 --> 00:04:42.935
<v Slow>コナンは、世界でも人気があります。

00:04:43.735 --> 00:04:46.687
<v Host>Conan is popular around the world too.

00:04:47.288 --> 00:04:49.519
<v Vocab>世界

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:54.480
<v Host>It means the world. Add it to say something is famous worldwide.

00:04:55.079 --> 00:05:00.959
<v Slow>ファンは、次の映画も楽しみにしています。

00:05:01.759 --> 00:05:04.855
<v Host>Fans are looking forward to the next movie too.

00:05:05.456 --> 00:05:07.783
<v Vocab>楽しみ

00:05:08.184 --> 00:05:13.752
<v Host>It means something you look forward to. It carries a warm, excited feeling.

